2026-09-14  Jörgen Johansson

	* Updated for the current ixemul.library source tree.
	* Removed completed, obsolete and currently excluded items.


***	Modernize and reorganize the Makefile/build system.


***	Add support for AF_UNIX/AF_LOCAL datagram sockets.


***	Add connection timeout handling to AF_UNIX connect().


***	Make AF_UNIX SO_RCVBUF, SO_SNDBUF, SO_RCVTIMEO and SO_SNDTIMEO
	settings affect the actual stream buffering and waiting behaviour,
	if this can be done without breaking existing semantics.


***	Add proper locale support.

***	Complete and restore manual-page documentation.
	Many of the functions added after ixemul 48.2 do not yet have man
	pages.  Add documentation for the new interfaces and keep existing
	manual pages in sync with the current implementation.

	Manual-page generation is currently disabled in the Makefile because
	groff/nroff hangs during the build process.  Find a reliable way to
	generate the documentation without blocking the ixemul build.

